    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": *Hic*",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whadr’ye lookin’ at, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Molly. I just figured I’d come keep you company since you’re drunk and alone and no one seems to be paying any attention to you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Story of my life.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where’s Tsuneyo?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ‘Ell if I know. Probably...bein’ a cat?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I ever tell you how I feel about cats?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think that topic has ever come up before, no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much have you had to drink?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain2.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that more or less answers that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ye want’some, Sensei? Can *hic* finish mine if ye pay me for it.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would I pay you for a half empty beer in a place where I can very likely get as many of them as I want for free?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ‘Alf empty?...Or 'alf full?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do I look like an optimist to you? Of course it’s half empty.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain3.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ha! Dass...where’yer wrong! I jusssssss...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Jusss opened this one, idiot.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, it appears that I may have shown up a bit too late to prevent Molly from slipping into an alcohol induced coma.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she still standing right now? Sure. But...there’s no way that’s going to last much longer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m glad she at least decided to drink alone instead of taking Kirin up on her offer, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s one thing to get blackout drunk, but a completely different thing to get blackout drunk around someone who would likely attempt to [molest] you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where did you even get that? I thought everyone was actively trying to prevent a repeat of last year.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain4.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Obvenously from the *hic* alcohol room.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Obviously. But that doesn’t explain-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei. Nooooobody’s tryin’ to stop me from doin’ anything.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba was.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
