      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s so *hic* hot...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, on the bright side, this time she’s yelling about lesbians and not her father.",
