      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really, though! Who the *hic* heck do they think they are?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is this? A love hotel? Have some tact!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They’re just...holding hands.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain11.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know! Disgusting, right?! In a place like *hic* this. The nerve!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be fair, the two of them are dating now and, if they want to hold hands in public, it’s well within their right to do so.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain12.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds to me like we got...*hic*...an imposter in our midst.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You got ta nerve...ta come over ta me...and not be on my side? Whaddya tink tis is? AMOGUS?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...have no idea what you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain13.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cause ya never try ta learn! All ya do is sit in your fancy office chair, eat hot chip, and lie!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How have you gotten drunker by just...standing there and not drinking?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had a whole other *hic* beer while you were starin’ off inta space!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ya see anytin’ out there, Sensei?! ‘Dya find Haruka’s husband?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When was I staring off into space?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain14",
