      "alt": "mollydrunkagain15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And now yer takin’ me freedom of speech?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somebody ping the mods!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, you know what? I’m going to be a responsible adult and confiscate that beer from-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain16",
