      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I shoulda never came to this party.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nobody wants ta talk to me when they’ve gotta burn their feet on coals ta do it.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S’one ting ta have Futaba ditch me for ‘er best friend, but th’rest o’ta manga club’s too’fraid ta’proach me while we’ve got Little Miss PDA and her super hot girlfriend makin’ hand sex at the table.",
