    {
      "en": ": Please don’t call holding hands “hand sex.” It makes me feel strange.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain15.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it makes you feel strange, imagine how I feel!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S’like when ya die to th’frickin’ dance on Council of Blood and have to sit there watchin’ everyone else boogie down while ya ask yer death knight for a b-res!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
