      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain17.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, sorry- Cole frickin’ Cassidy’s ‘is name now because Blizzard’s conflict resolution team’s run by a’bunch’a monkeys.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly is so drunk at this point that she has begun making up words and people and...I really have no idea how to handle it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure it doesn’t feel great being you right now, but...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain18.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what, Sir? What can ya possibly say right now tat’ll make me feel any better?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, I probably should have thought of that before speaking because I’ve honestly got nothing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But hey. I’m here. And I’ve been diffusing problems left and right since I showed up.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This obviously isn’t true since I’ve been tossed into four or five of them at this point and really haven’t resolved any.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But Molly doesn’t need to know that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She just needs someone to lean on.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Literally, because she is going to fall over any minute now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain19.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...yeah...you’re here.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But so am I. And that’s exactly the problem, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go back to calling me Sir, please. Hearing you say “Sensei” repeatedly is somehow the weirdest part of all of this to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain20.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll try, Sir. But I can barely feel me face right now.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain21.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like...look!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she tryin’ to make me jealous or d’she literally forget I exist? Which one is it, Sir?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Neither?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s just enjoying herself with her new girlfriend.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain22.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wanna be the new girlfriend...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not even succeeding at being Molly right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You drank yourself into a stupor to avoid having to deal with your problems because you can’t play video games right now and are handling the consequences of that decision by just...complaining.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain23.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sounds pretty familiar to me, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothin’ says the Emerald Guardian like hidin’ your problems behind other stuff while *hic* shummle...taneously complainin’ about ‘em.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Simultaneously.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain24.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not smarter than me!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe not, but I am sober- which allows me to do this thing where I say words correctly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve been on my case ta whole night! Why aren’t ya makin’ me feel better?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you want me to do? Go force Rin to talk to you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The last time we tried that, she not only made you cry, but made me sit there holding her arm closed so she didn’t bleed out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain20.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bet her new girlfriend doesn’t even know about that yet.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": F’I know Rin, she’s just gonna hide it and hide it and hide it and pretend everyting’s okay ‘til she gets caught.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S’what she always does. I know ‘er better t’en I know meself.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That checks out. Because pretending everything is okay until you get caught is exactly what you did concerning your feelings for her, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain25.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t cry.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain26.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was so mean!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It wasn’t meant to be mean. I’m just pointing out how you and Rin aren’t that different-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know that, Sir! Why do you think I like her so much?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, I know you’re drunk, but someone is going to hear you if you keep yelling like that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let ‘em! S’not like t’ey care anyway!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course they do. They...probably just don’t want to spend a night that is supposed to be fun consoling a drunken girl who’s still pining after a friend in a relationship.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain25.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are on her side...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, there are no sides. You’re both [teenager]s with little to no impulse control who are going to get hurt and make stupid decisions because that is the part of life you’re in right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just trying to avoid you making things worse than they already are, which, judging by the condition you’re in and the literal tears in your eyes, is pretty bad.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain26.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": L-Leave me alone!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, come on.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...going home!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can barely stand up.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain27.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You! Butler! Hold my potion!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, that’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain28",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain28.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain28"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not a butler...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t follow me!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any idea how many hallways this place has? No one will ever see you again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well maybe things are *hic* better that way!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, come-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Goodbye forever!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly opens up some door near the back of the room and disappears inside.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not only am I thankful that she didn’t elect to turn into the hall of many halls (The cool name I’ve decided to give to Ayane’s maze thing), but I’m glad she’s going to be alone for a while.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Granted, she’s been alone ever since Futaba left her side- but still.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She’s safer locked away in some room than out in the open, screaming about how mean I am and how her friend should be dating her instead.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, at the same time, thousands of people die every year by choking on their vomit after passing out drunk.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s not a real statistic, but it sounds believable enough and I know for a fact that it does happen sometimes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Damn it. Where’s Tsuneyo?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go to her.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain29.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uta?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain30",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain30.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": N...Nyaa~",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much of that did you hear?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain29.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Enough to know that you hurt Molly’s feelings.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thankfully, she won’t remember that I hurt her feelings because of how drunk she is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain31",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain31.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain31"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should still go to her, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if it wasn’t on purpose, you made her cry. So now it’s your job to make her feel better.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you even doing over here? I thought you were playing a game with Nodoka and company.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We were.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...we are.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is...",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain32",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain32.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain32"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nyaa...",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t speak cat.",
