      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...go check on her.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll make sure no one gets in the way.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...definitely attracted some attention with Molly’s yelling...and...my group was kind of already looking over here, so...",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want to come with me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain33",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain33.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain33"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nyaa?",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Is that a yes or?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would I come?",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just had a feeling you might want to.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollydrunkagain34",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollydrunkagain34.webp",
      "alt": "mollydrunkagain34"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should go alone.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
